        "original_id": "e13c4650-258c-5a5d-877e-588001a83ecc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Richard Fisk, Wilson Fisk, Vanessa Fisk, Stan Lee, John Romita Sr.\n- Characters: Kingpin\n- Organizations: Marvel Comics\n- Publications: The Amazing Spider-Man #50\n- Topics: family relationships, character roles, character creation\n\nFacts:\n- Kingpin is a fictional supervillain named Wilson Fisk who appears in American comic books published by Marvel Comics.\n- Kingpin was created by Stan Lee and John Romita Sr. and first appeared in The Amazing Spider-Man #50 with a cover date of July 1967.\n- Richard Fisk is the son of Kingpin and Vanessa Fisk.\n- Richard Fisk was originally a villain and later became an antihero.",
